  "content": "<h1>工廠方塊</h1><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisel-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要安裝 Chisel</a>，<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/athena\" rel=\"nofollow\">建議安裝 Athena</a> 以實現連接紋理</p><p>或者<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chipped\" rel=\"nofollow\">支援 Chipped</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" rel=\"nofollow\">建議安裝 Continuity</a> 以實現連接紋理</p><p>此外，您也可以同時使用 Chisel 和 Chipped，Athena 和 Continuity 亦然</p><h2>圖片展示</h2><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ncc4gIn.gif\" alt=\"展示\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Lc34uAS.png\" alt=\"合成\"></p><h3>Chisel 物品欄預覽：</h3><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Kh8h2jS.png\" alt=\"方塊\"></p><h3>Chipped 物品欄預覽：</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ht0eTMEs/images/3ffff922199af42053d4f612db95640d82828b39.png\" alt=\"Chipped 方塊\"></p>",
